1
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:11,300
The caterer sent me this list of 12 appetizers. I have to narrow it to 6.
外燴的公司給我十二道開胃菜清單 我得將選擇範圍縮小到六項

2
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:13,630
Food? Oh, give me.
食物問題？交給我吧

3
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:19,140
Did Monica mention we're trying to get The Swing Kings to play the wedding?
摩妮卡跟你們提過我們結婚時 要請搖擺國王來演唱嗎？

4
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:20,970
You're into swing music?
你喜歡搖擺音樂？

5
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:24,810
I used to go all over town listening to bands.
我以前會跑遍全城聽樂團演奏

6
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:28,350
-Chandler? -Gap commercial.
-錢德？ -在GAP的廣告看到的

7
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:33,820
-Did you book them? Did you call? -I will.
-你打電話訂下他們了嗎？ -我會打的

8
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:38,330
-You want me to call? -I'll do it. You stick to your job.
-你要我打嗎？ -我會打的，你只需要做好你的工作

9
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:41,500
-What is your job? -Staying out of the way.
-你的工作是什麼？ -別礙事

10
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:46,540
This is impossible. Why don't you just pick all 15?
這是不可能的，你為什麼不挑清單上的十五道開胃菜？

11
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:50,370
-There were only 12. -Oh, yeah, I added 3.
-只有十二道而已 -對，我加了三道

12
00:00:50,610 --> 00:00:53,210
What are "peanut-butter fingers"?
什麼是花生醬手指？

13
00:00:59,890 --> 00:01:02,050
The One With the Cheap Wedding Dress
本集播出：廉價的婚紗

00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:04,660
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

14
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:46,660
Well, hello.
你好

15
00:01:46,870 --> 00:01:48,670
She's cute.
她好可愛

16
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:51,030
Should we go talk to her?
我們該跟她說話嗎？

17
00:01:51,270 --> 00:01:56,440
Sure. Being engaged, I'm not nervous to talk to pretty girls anymore.
當然，訂婚後跟美女說話 我再也不會緊張

18
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:58,700
Could you guys help me?
你們能過來幫幫我嗎？

19
00:02:01,580 --> 00:02:03,920
Yeah, let me get that for you.
我來幫你搬那個

20
00:02:04,150 --> 00:02:07,950
-It's really heavy. -I got it.
-它真的很重 -沒問題

21
00:02:11,190 --> 00:02:15,790
So hi, I'm Ross, and this is my friend, Chandler.
嗨，我是羅斯，他是我朋友錢德

22
00:02:18,170 --> 00:02:19,760
I'm Kristen.
我是克麗絲汀

23
00:02:19,970 --> 00:02:22,400
Hi. Are you new to the area?
克麗絲汀，嗨，你剛搬來嗎？

24
00:02:22,670 --> 00:02:25,660
I'd love to show you around sometime.
如果你剛搬來這裡 我可以帶你四處參觀一下

25
00:02:25,870 --> 00:02:29,370
I actually just moved from four blocks over.
事實上，我從四條街外搬來這裡

26
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:32,070
But this block is like another world.
但這裡好像另一個世界

27
00:02:32,350 --> 00:02:36,280
Actually, it does have a very interesting history.
事實上這個地區的歷史非常有趣

28
00:02:36,550 --> 00:02:41,960
This street is the first in the city to have an underground sewer system.
這條街是紐約 第一條有下水道系統的街道

29
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:45,290
Before that, sewage and waste...
之前污水跟廢棄物…

30
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:48,760
would just flow right down the street.
會直接流到街上

31
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:51,660
Sometimes ankle-deep.
有時深及腳踝

32
00:02:52,770 --> 00:02:54,360
Smooth.
說的好

33
00:02:56,070 --> 00:02:57,900
Excuse me?
你說什麼？

34
00:03:00,610 --> 00:03:05,980
You're gonna be starving after moving. What do you say I take you to dinner?
搬完家後你一定會肚子餓 你想跟我一起去吃晚餐嗎？

35
00:03:06,210 --> 00:03:07,940
-I'd like that. -Great.
-我很樂意 -太棒了

36
00:03:08,180 --> 00:03:09,410
Let me take this up.
我幫你把箱子搬上去

37
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:12,920
-After you. -Oh, no. After you.
-你先請 -不，你先請

38
00:03:14,620 --> 00:03:16,450
Oh, my God!
我的天啊！

39
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:27,730
Am I crazy, or does this totally go?
是我瘋了還是這真的很配？

40
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:33,410
Oh, my God! You look so beautiful!
我的天啊！你看起來好漂亮！

41
00:03:33,610 --> 00:03:36,910
Thank you, Rachel. But look at Monica!
謝謝你，瑞秋，但看看摩妮卡！

42
00:03:37,910 --> 00:03:41,080
This is it. Yeah, this is the one.
就是它，就是這件

43
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:43,580
I can't believe I found it.
我不敢相信我找到它了

44
00:03:43,820 --> 00:03:48,450
Wow, you look so beautiful. If I knew you, I'd cry.
你看起來好漂亮 如果我認識你，我會哭的

45
00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:52,120
I'm Monica Geller. Bawl like a baby.
我是摩妮卡蓋勒，幸福的新娘

46
00:03:52,330 --> 00:03:53,730
I'm Megan Bailey.
我是梅根巴利

47
00:03:53,930 --> 00:03:57,590
-Have you found your dress? -These dresses are amazing...
-你找到婚紗了嗎？ -這些婚紗都很漂亮…

48
00:03:57,830 --> 00:04:01,430
-but I couldn't afford one. -I can't either.
-但我買不起 -我也是

49
00:04:01,670 --> 00:04:06,500
I'm here to figure out the one I want,  then I'll get it at Kleinman's.
我只是來這裡找婚紗 然後我會到克萊門婚紗店買

50
00:04:06,770 --> 00:04:08,940
They're having a huge sale.
他們在大減價

51
00:04:09,140 --> 00:04:12,480
-Thanks for the tip. -When are you getting married?
-謝謝你的情報 -你什麼時候結婚？

52
00:04:12,750 --> 00:04:17,780
-I'm not. I just like to try them on. -I do the same thing.
-我沒有要結婚，我只是想試穿婚紗 -我也會那麼做

53
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:22,490
I'm just kidding. I'm getting married July 25th.
我只是在開玩笑 我的婚期是七月二十五日

54
00:04:23,290 --> 00:04:25,520
I'm just kidding too.
我也只是在開玩笑

55
00:04:25,790 --> 00:04:28,390
I'm getting married in December.
我要在十二月結婚

56
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:32,860
-When are you getting married? -May 15th.
-你什麼時候結婚？ -五月十五日

57
00:04:33,130 --> 00:04:35,690
It's close. Who's your photographer?
已經很接近了，你請誰拍照？

58
00:04:35,970 --> 00:04:37,700
-Jeffrey. -We met with him.
-傑佛瑞 -我們跟他談過

59
00:04:37,970 --> 00:04:43,000
-Did he show you nude wedding photos? -The Best Man? Wow!
-他拿裸體婚紗照給你們看了嗎？ -那個伴郎嗎？哇！

60
00:04:43,410 --> 00:04:46,380
I know. I almost called off my wedding.
我知道，我差點取消了婚禮

61
00:04:46,650 --> 00:04:50,180
-Who's your band? -My fiance wants The Swing Kings.
-你請了哪個樂團？ -我未婚夫想請搖擺國王

62
00:04:50,390 --> 00:04:54,520
You're lucky. My fiance wants the heavy metal band, Carcass.
你真幸運，我未婚夫想請屍體 那重金屬樂團

63
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:59,660
Is that spelled with a "C" or a "K"? It doesn't matter, they're both great!
是濕體還是屍體？ 那不重要，他們都很棒！

64
00:05:01,430 --> 00:05:03,490
Oh, don't buy that here.
別在這裡買婚紗

65
00:05:03,700 --> 00:05:07,330
Now that you know what you want,  go to Kleinman's.
現在你知道你喜歡哪一件 到克萊門婚紗店買

66
00:05:07,570 --> 00:05:09,700
This place is so overpriced.
這裡的婚紗太貴了

67
00:05:09,900 --> 00:05:11,840
I own this store.
我是這裡的老闆

68
00:05:13,510 --> 00:05:17,000
So does this come in another color, or...
這件婚紗有別的顏色嗎？還是…？

69
00:05:26,550 --> 00:05:29,820
Hi. You moving in or moving out?
嗨，你要搬進來還是搬走？

70
00:05:30,020 --> 00:05:32,020
-Moving in. -Can I help out?
-我要搬進來 -需要我幫忙嗎？

71
00:05:32,230 --> 00:05:37,100
Okay, but be careful. The guy who was helping before hurt his back.
好吧，但是你得小心一點 來幫我的那個人因為背痛先走了

72
00:05:38,030 --> 00:05:39,690
-Boyfriend? -No.
-他是你男朋友？ -不是

73
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:41,600
I'm Joey.
我是喬伊

74
00:05:42,270 --> 00:05:43,330
Kristen.
我是克麗絲汀

75
00:05:43,540 --> 00:05:46,410
What a beautiful name.
你的名字真好聽

76
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,330
What is it again?
你說你叫什麼來著？

77
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:52,040
Kristen.
克麗絲汀

78
00:05:53,450 --> 00:05:56,210
-You live around here? -Right down there.
-你住在附近？ -我就住在那邊

79
00:05:56,450 --> 00:05:58,280
Let me give you a tip.
我得提供你一些資訊

80
00:05:58,550 --> 00:06:03,290
Don't take a nap on this stoop. You could wake up without shoes.
別在那個樓梯上睡覺 醒過來時你的鞋子可能已經被偷了

81
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,790
I'll remember that.
我會記住的

82
00:06:06,060 --> 00:06:10,660
Listen, would you like to have dinner with me tonight?
聽著，今晚你要跟我一起吃飯嗎？

83
00:06:10,900 --> 00:06:14,060
I have plans tonight. How about tomorrow?
今晚我有約了，明天可以嗎？

84
00:06:14,270 --> 00:06:16,860
Sounds great. Well, where does this go?
聽起來不錯，這個要搬到哪裡？

85
00:06:17,070 --> 00:06:20,800
You look strong. Why don't you grab one of the boxes.
你看起來很壯，把它交給我 你去幫我搬箱子吧

86
00:06:23,783 --> 00:06:25,410
（書，枕頭）

87
00:06:25,650 --> 00:06:27,940
Yeah, I'll get this one.
對，我要挑這一個

88
00:06:30,623 --> 00:06:32,682
（克萊門婚紗店五折大減價）

89
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:39,780
So this is Brooklyn?
這裡就是布魯克林？

90
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:44,090
Listen up. There's only one dress in each size.
聽著，通常每件婚紗 一個尺寸只有一件

91
00:06:44,330 --> 00:06:47,770
So when they open those doors,  fan out.
他們一開門，馬上衝進去

92
00:06:48,170 --> 00:06:52,900
This is what you're looking for. Memorize it.
這就是你們的目標，記住它

93
00:06:53,810 --> 00:06:58,210
When you locate the dress,  blow on these, all right?
找到婚紗後就吹哨子，好嗎？

94
00:06:59,280 --> 00:07:03,550
Three sharp blasts. When you hear it, come running.
用力吹三聲，一聽到哨音後 馬上跑過來

95
00:07:04,790 --> 00:07:05,780
Here he comes!
他來了！

96
00:07:06,020 --> 00:07:09,290
-They're pushing! -Don't be a baby!
-她們在推我！ -別那麼孩子氣！

97
00:07:09,490 --> 00:07:11,980
-Out of the way! -Let's go!
-別擋路！ -我們沖吧！

98
00:07:12,690 --> 00:07:15,320
Rachel?! Come on!
瑞秋？！快一點！

99
00:07:24,510 --> 00:07:28,170
No, not it. Not it. Not it.
不，不是

100
00:07:30,850 --> 00:07:32,970
Don't crowd me.
別推我

101
00:07:35,350 --> 00:07:38,510
This is it! This is the dress! It's perfect!
就是它！就是這件婚紗！太完美了！

102
00:07:38,750 --> 00:07:40,880
I'm sorry, this one's taken!
對不起，這件是我的！

103
00:07:43,020 --> 00:07:44,860
-Megan! -Monica!
-梅根！ -摩妮卡！

104
00:07:45,090 --> 00:07:46,720
-You came! -Yeah!
-你來了！ -對！

105
00:07:46,990 --> 00:07:49,690
-This is my dress! -No!
-這是我的婚紗！ -不！

106
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:53,870
-You saw me wearing it. -And now you'll see me buying it.
-你看到我試穿它 -現在你會看到我買下它

107
00:07:54,100 --> 00:07:56,260
You freak!
你這個怪胎！

108
00:07:56,670 --> 00:07:59,270
You wouldn't even know about this place without me.
如果沒有我你根本不知道這個地方

109
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:04,880
-Look, you don't want to fight me. -Maybe I do. I'm pretty feisty!
-聽著，你不會想跟我爭 -或許我想，我是很凶的！

110
00:08:06,050 --> 00:08:08,610
-I'm coming! I'm coming! -Hey!
-我來了… -嘿！

111
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:13,980
Okay! Hey? Oh, what do I do?!
好了！嘿？我該怎麼辦？！

112
00:08:20,290 --> 00:08:24,490
What are you doing? Did you find the dress?
你在做什麼？你找到婚紗了嗎？

113
00:08:24,770 --> 00:08:26,130
Did you find the dress?
你找到婚紗了嗎？

114
00:08:26,370 --> 00:08:28,700
No. You gotta get me out of here.
不，快救我出去，這些女人都瘋了

115
00:08:28,940 --> 00:08:32,390
-We've gotta get Monica. -You hold my hand!
-我們得去找摩妮卡 -你得抓住我的手！

116
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:36,910
Excuse me! Excuse me!
對不起…

117
00:08:38,650 --> 00:08:41,140
Go! Go! Go!
快走…

118
00:08:50,396 --> 00:08:52,626
（中央公園咖啡廳）

119
00:08:52,890 --> 00:08:55,230
How was your date the other night?
羅斯，那天你跟她約會還順利吧？

120
00:08:55,430 --> 00:09:00,460
Did you tell her about the magical ride that starts with every flush?
你跟她提過只要一按馬桶 魔法之旅就開始了嗎？

121
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:06,840
Laugh all you want, but she said she'd like to go out again.
儘管笑吧，但她說她想再跟我約會

122
00:09:07,780 --> 00:09:10,400
In fact, I'll go call her right now.
事實上，我正要打電話給她

123
00:09:10,650 --> 00:09:15,140
And I'll make sure and tell her my friend Chandler says...
我會確定並告訴她我朋友錢德說…

124
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:23,750
Sorry I didn't stop by last night, but I had a date.
抱歉昨晚我失約了，但我有個約會

125
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:28,190
When it's 1:00 in the morning and you don't come by, that's okay.
你說你凌晨一點要過來 就算你放我鴿子也沒有關係

126
00:09:28,460 --> 00:09:33,300
It was with this really hot girl who moved in across the street.
我跟一個辣妹約會，她剛剛搬到對街

127
00:09:33,570 --> 00:09:36,300
-Right across the street? -Yeah.
-真的嗎？她住在對街？ -對

128
00:09:36,500 --> 00:09:38,840
-When did you meet her? -Two days ago.
-你什麼時候認識她的？ -兩天前

129
00:09:39,070 --> 00:09:41,630
Excellent!
太棒了！

130
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:45,200
You know, Ross met somebody too.
羅斯也認識了一個女孩

131
00:09:45,450 --> 00:09:46,780
-Hey. -How'd it go?
-嘿 -怎麼樣？

132
00:09:47,010 --> 00:09:49,140
We're going out again Saturday.
太棒了，我們星期六要再出去玩

133
00:09:49,350 --> 00:09:54,150
But I found out she's also seeing some other guy.
但我剛剛發現她也在跟別人約會

134
00:09:55,820 --> 00:09:57,880
Really?
真的嗎？

135
00:09:59,190 --> 00:10:03,290
Joe, what would you do if you were in Ross' situation?
喬伊，如果你是羅斯你會怎麼做？

136
00:10:03,500 --> 00:10:07,800
I am. I'm dating this girl who's also seeing another guy.
我跟他差不多 跟我約會的女孩也在跟別人約會

137
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:10,160
But I'm not worried about it.
但我一點都不擔心

138
00:10:10,370 --> 00:10:15,640
You shouldn't be. I wouldn't want to be the guy who's up against you.
你不必擔心，我不想當你的競爭者

139
00:10:16,910 --> 00:10:20,140
I mean, that doofus is going to lose.
那個混蛋一定會輸的

140
00:10:22,180 --> 00:10:25,050
So this is nice.
這真的太有趣了

141
00:10:27,190 --> 00:10:30,750
I wish I didn't have to go. Believe me.
真希望我能留下來，相信我

142
00:10:30,990 --> 00:10:32,190
But I have to.
但我得走了

143
00:10:32,430 --> 00:10:35,360
So, what's the name of the girl you're dating?
對了，跟你們約會的女孩 叫什麼名字？

144
00:10:35,630 --> 00:10:38,160
-Kristen Leigh. -Bye.
-克麗絲汀萊夫 -再見

145
00:10:46,940 --> 00:10:49,970
Well, only one of us can keep dating her.
很明顯地，我們之中 只有一個人能繼續跟她約會

146
00:10:50,210 --> 00:10:53,870
Obviously. So how do we decide?
沒錯，我們該怎麼決定？

147
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:57,570
Well, now,  let's look at this objectively.
好了，我們得客觀地來解決這件事

148
00:10:57,850 --> 00:11:00,120
I think I should date her.
我想我該跟她約會

149
00:11:03,290 --> 00:11:07,120
Or I'm the one who dates her.
或是我該跟她約會

150
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:11,960
That's interesting. But check this out. I date her.
那真的很有趣 但是聽好了，我跟她約會

151
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:14,890
Okay, but to go in another direction..
好吧，但是換個角度來說…

152
00:11:15,140 --> 00:11:17,500
Okay. This can go on for a while.
好吧，我們是談不出結論來的

153
00:11:17,710 --> 00:11:20,770
-We should order some food then. -No, Joey.
-那麼我們該點些吃的 -不，喬伊

154
00:11:22,340 --> 00:11:25,900
Look, why don't we just let her decide, okay?
聽著，我們為什麼不讓她來決定呢？

155
00:11:26,150 --> 00:11:28,950
We'll each go out with her one more time.
我們都再跟她約會一次

156
00:11:29,220 --> 00:11:31,780
And we'll see who she likes best.
看看她比較喜歡誰

157
00:11:32,890 --> 00:11:35,150
That sounds fair.
聽起來很公平

158
00:11:35,490 --> 00:11:39,220
Maybe I'll take her to that new French restaurant.
或許我會帶她 到新開的法國餐廳吃飯

159
00:11:39,430 --> 00:11:42,590
Wait a second. We have to set a spending limit.
等一下，我們得對約會費用設下限制

160
00:11:42,860 --> 00:11:45,920
I can't take her to a fancy place like that.
我沒有錢帶她到高級餐廳吃飯

161
00:11:46,130 --> 00:11:50,000
Well, sorry. That's what I do on dates.
抱歉，那是我的約會方式

162
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:54,800
Well, I guess I'll just have to do what I do on dates.
我猜我得用我的約會方式

163
00:12:00,450 --> 00:12:03,940
-So let's decide on a spending limit. -Yeah.
-我們來決定費用上限 -好吧

164
00:12:07,690 --> 00:12:10,420
And a slice...
大概是…

165
00:12:11,830 --> 00:12:13,790
six dollars?
六塊錢？

166
00:12:15,300 --> 00:12:18,530
-I was thinking more like 100. -Okay.
-我想是一百塊 -好吧

167
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:21,530
Can I borrow 94 dollars?
你能借我九十四塊嗎？

168
00:12:28,710 --> 00:12:31,910
I know. Can you hand me a tissue?
我知道，你能幫我拿張面紙嗎？

169
00:12:39,790 --> 00:12:42,120
You're out of Diet Coke.
你家沒有健怡可樂了

170
00:12:45,690 --> 00:12:46,720
Hello?
喂？

171
00:12:47,630 --> 00:12:50,930
What? You what?
什麼？你什麼？

172
00:12:51,170 --> 00:12:52,960
You listen here, missy!
你給我聽好了，小姐！

173
00:12:56,540 --> 00:13:00,470
Megan booked The Swing Kings on the day of our wedding...
是梅根打來的，她訂下搖擺國王 日期是我們結婚的那一天…

174
00:13:00,670 --> 00:13:04,200
and said she'd only give them back for the dress!
還說如果我不把婚紗讓給她 我就沒有樂團

175
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:07,470
Does that mean Carcass is available?
那麼說的話屍體有空了？

176
00:13:08,980 --> 00:13:13,580
What am I gonna do? That's the dress! That is "the" dress!
我該怎麼辦？我好喜歡那件婚紗！

177
00:13:14,260 --> 00:13:17,660
Chandler wants the band. What do I do?
錢德喜歡那個樂團，我該怎麼辦？

178
00:13:17,860 --> 00:13:21,730
-Figure out how to talk him out of it. -How?
-想辦法說服他放棄 -怎麼說服？

179
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:24,090
You're out of toilet paper!
你家的衛生紙用完了！

180
00:13:33,670 --> 00:13:36,580
I wanted to wish you good luck on your date.
我要來祝你約會順利

181
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:39,040
-Thanks. -What time are you meeting?
-謝謝 -你們約幾點？

182
00:13:39,280 --> 00:13:42,410
We have reservations at Grand Merci Bistro at 8.
我們在葛蘭梅西畢斯多餐廳 訂了八點的位子

183
00:13:42,620 --> 00:13:45,980
That's in 20 minutes. You'd better get dressed.
時間只剩二十分鐘 你最好快去換衣服

184
00:13:47,420 --> 00:13:50,980
-I am dressed. -Oh, well, good.
-我已經換好衣服了 -太好了

185
00:13:51,230 --> 00:13:53,220
For me.
對我來說

186
00:13:55,260 --> 00:13:58,130
What's this? Did you give yourself a facial?
這是什麼？你在敷臉？

187
00:13:58,370 --> 00:14:00,930
I have an oily T-zone.
我的T字部位很會出油

188
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:04,060
Okay, dude.
好吧，兄弟

189
00:14:07,070 --> 00:14:09,940
-You sent Kristen flowers? -That's right.
-你送克麗絲汀花？ -沒錯

190
00:14:10,540 --> 00:14:15,000
You spent 100 dollars. That's the limit. You're screwed!
你花了一百塊 你把錢花光了，你輸了！

191
00:14:15,820 --> 00:14:20,050
I sent the flowers before the actual date, so technically...
我在約會前送她花 所以技術上來說…

192
00:14:20,290 --> 00:14:23,150
I didn't break any rules.
我沒有犯規

193
00:14:23,420 --> 00:14:25,390
Thanks for stopping by though.
謝謝你來看我

194
00:14:25,590 --> 00:14:29,030
That's how it's gonna be? I can break the rules too.
你真的要那麼玩？我也可以犯規

195
00:14:29,230 --> 00:14:31,760
-What are you gonna do? -I don't know.
-你打算怎麼辦？ -我不知道

196
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:35,020
-I'm not surprised. -You won't get away with this.
-為什麼我一點都不訝異？ -我不會放過你的

197
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:38,400
-You don't have much choice. -We'll see!
-我想你沒有太多選擇 -我們走著瞧

198
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:43,310
Hey! So, just a light layer?
嘿！只要薄薄地敷一層就好？

199
00:14:43,540 --> 00:14:46,170
Yeah, just here and there.
對，只要敷這裡跟這裡

200
00:14:52,620 --> 00:14:56,420
Joey got meat sauce on the banister again.
喬伊又把肉醬滴在欄杆上了

201
00:14:57,760 --> 00:14:59,620
Swing music is so out.
搖擺音樂太落伍了

202
00:14:59,830 --> 00:15:03,290
He's gotta be in the room for that to work.
他得在這房間裡才可以聽的到

203
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:06,670
What are you guys talking about?
你們到底在說什麼？

204
00:15:06,870 --> 00:15:09,360
We're talking about The Swing Kings...
我們在談搖擺國王…

205
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:12,330
and whether they're the right way to go.
討論到底該不該請他們來

206
00:15:12,570 --> 00:15:16,010
I went to a wedding where they had swing music...
有一次我去參加 請搖擺樂團來表演的婚禮…

207
00:15:16,210 --> 00:15:18,940
two months later the couple divorced.
兩個月後他們就離婚了

208
00:15:19,150 --> 00:15:22,510
I'm not saying there's any connection here...
我不是說這其中有什麼關係…

209
00:15:22,780 --> 00:15:26,120
but they did say that's why they got divorced.
但他們的確告訴我 那是他們離婚的原因

210
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:29,480
But I love swing music!
但我喜歡搖擺音樂！

211
00:15:29,690 --> 00:15:31,350
But The Swing Kings?
但搖擺國王？

212
00:15:31,630 --> 00:15:37,000
They suck so much that people die at their concerts. They stop living.
他們爛到有人聽他們的演唱會死掉 他們就是不想活了

213
00:15:37,800 --> 00:15:41,100
When Monica and I went to see them,  we had fun.
我只知道摩妮卡跟我 去看他們演唱時非常開心

214
00:15:41,340 --> 00:15:43,030
And there's another reason.
事實上還有一個原因

215
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:47,540
-Well, what is the other reason? -I don't want to say.
-是什麼原因？ -我不想說

216
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:51,340
Well, you have to,  because maybe it's stupid.
你非說不可，或許它很愚蠢

217
00:15:52,980 --> 00:15:57,210
It's just, while Monica and I were dancing to them...
摩妮卡跟我隨著他們的音樂起舞…

218
00:15:57,480 --> 00:16:00,650
it was the first time I knew that...
我第一次知道…

219
00:16:01,220 --> 00:16:05,680
you were the woman that I wanted to dance all my dances with.
你就是我想一輩子共舞的女人

220
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:10,430
Oh, crap.
喔，爛透了

221
00:16:18,210 --> 00:16:22,140
-Our table will be ready soon. -Oh, great.
-我們的桌子馬上就會準備好 -太棒了

222
00:16:22,380 --> 00:16:25,570
-Is your back feeling better? -That's fine.
-你的背好一點了嗎？ -沒事了

223
00:16:25,780 --> 00:16:28,580
I guess the more muscles you have...
我猜肌肉越多…

224
00:16:28,850 --> 00:16:32,950
the more they can spasm out of control.
就越可能抽筋

225
00:16:33,750 --> 00:16:36,150
-Kristen? -Joey!
-克麗絲汀？ -喬伊！

226
00:16:39,390 --> 00:16:42,420
-What are you doing here? -I like this place.
-你來這裡做什麼？ -我喜歡這個地方

227
00:16:42,660 --> 00:16:47,400
And technically, I'm not breaking any rules, so...
技術上來說，我沒有犯規，所以…

228
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:51,870
Well, Ross, this is Joey. Joey, Ross.
羅斯，他是喬伊 喬伊，羅斯

229
00:16:52,110 --> 00:16:54,730
-Hi. -Hi. It's nice to meet you.
-嗨 -嗨，很高興能認識你

230
00:16:54,980 --> 00:16:58,210
I used to have a friend named Joey.
我以前有個朋友叫喬伊

231
00:16:59,380 --> 00:17:01,750
I don't anymore.
但他不再是我朋友

232
00:17:03,180 --> 00:17:06,180
Our table will be ready in a couple minutes.
我們的桌子馬上就會準備好

233
00:17:06,390 --> 00:17:10,480
Sure! I would love to wait with you guys! Thanks!
當然，我想跟你們一起等！謝謝！

234
00:17:14,430 --> 00:17:17,260
So, Joey, you look familiar.
喬伊，你看起來好眼熟

235
00:17:17,500 --> 00:17:20,230
Are you on TV or something?
你上過電視嗎？

236
00:17:20,430 --> 00:17:22,630
He doesn't like to talk about it...
喬伊不喜歡提這件事…

237
00:17:22,900 --> 00:17:26,300
but he's one of the stars of Days of Our Lives.
但他主演過《我們的日子》

238
00:17:27,210 --> 00:17:31,340
That's right. Don't you play a woman?
沒錯，你不是演女人嗎？

239
00:17:34,310 --> 00:17:37,410
A woman in a man's body.
那是被困在男人身體裡的女人

240
00:17:37,650 --> 00:17:39,740
Much better.
那可好多了

241
00:17:40,850 --> 00:17:43,950
It's funny, because you look familiar to me too.
真有趣，因為我也覺得你很眼熟

242
00:17:44,220 --> 00:17:46,720
Have you ever been married?
你結過婚嗎？

243
00:17:48,460 --> 00:17:49,490
Yes, I have.
我結過婚

244
00:17:49,760 --> 00:17:51,990
In fact, just the other day...
事實上，前幾天…

245
00:17:52,230 --> 00:17:56,360
Kris and I talked about how I've been married and have a son.
克麗絲跟我還談到 我結過婚，有個兒子

246
00:17:56,640 --> 00:18:00,660
-Little Eric. -That's right. Wait. No, Ben.
-小艾力克 -沒錯，等一下，不，是班才對

247
00:18:03,310 --> 00:18:06,510
So you've just been married the one time then?
你只結過一次婚嗎？

248
00:18:08,820 --> 00:18:12,650
-Well... -You've been married twice?
-嗯… -你結過兩次婚？

249
00:18:12,850 --> 00:18:16,620
Yes. And...
對，那個…

250
00:18:16,820 --> 00:18:19,520
another time after that.
之後又結了一次

251
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:24,550
Boy, I'm getting hungry.
天啊，我餓了

252
00:18:24,830 --> 00:18:27,890
Have you ever been so hungry on a date...
你曾經在約會時餓到…

253
00:18:28,170 --> 00:18:32,570
that when the girl goes to the bathroom, you eat her food?
趁女伴去上洗手間 偷吃掉她的食物嗎？

254
00:18:35,010 --> 00:18:38,310
You said the waiter ate my crab cake.
你說服務生吃掉我的蟹餅

255
00:18:40,380 --> 00:18:45,280
So, Ross, now why did that first marriage break up?
羅斯，你的第一段婚姻為什麼會結束？

256
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:50,550
Was it because the woman was straight or because she was a lesbian?
因為你前妻是異性戀 或因為她是同性戀？

257
00:18:52,060 --> 00:18:55,290
-Do you two know each other? -No.
-你們認識嗎？ -不認識

258
00:18:55,500 --> 00:18:58,330
But he seems like a guy who'd marry a woman...
只是羅斯看起來像是 會跟有同性戀傾向的女人…

259
00:18:58,530 --> 00:19:03,060
on the verge of being a lesbian and then push her over the edge.
結婚後，逼得她非得出櫃的男人

260
00:19:06,010 --> 00:19:10,600
Wait a minute! Were you on a poster for gonorrhea?
等一下，你拍過淋病海報吧？

261
00:19:13,380 --> 00:19:17,010
Have you ever slept in the same bed with a monkey?
你跟猴子同床共枕過吧？

262
00:19:17,820 --> 00:19:20,120
You leave Marcel out of this!
別把馬賽扯進來！

263
00:19:20,350 --> 00:19:23,950
Fine! You ever gotten stuck in a pair of leather pants?
好吧，你曾經被自己的皮褲卡住了？

264
00:19:24,220 --> 00:19:28,820
Have you ever locked yourself in a TV cabinet, VD-boy?
你曾經把自己鎖在電視櫃裡嗎？電視小子

265
00:19:29,030 --> 00:19:31,260
Monkey-lover!
猴子迷！

266
00:19:39,070 --> 00:19:41,470
Where do you think we lost her?
你覺得她是什麼時候離開的？

267
00:19:41,910 --> 00:19:44,470
Probably around gonorrhea.
可能是淋病那一段吧

268
00:19:52,650 --> 00:19:55,450
-Hi, honey, I'm home! -Don't come in here!
-甜心，我回來了！ -別進來！

269
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:59,560
Why, do you have another boyfriend in there?
怎麼了？你的另一個男朋友在裡面？

270
00:19:59,760 --> 00:20:02,750
No. We only mess around at his place.
不，我們只會在他家胡搞

271
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:08,590
I started it, but now it's scaring me,  so could you come out here?
雖然是我開的頭 但我開始擔心了，你能出來嗎？

272
00:20:08,870 --> 00:20:10,560
I'm wearing a wedding dress.
不行，我正穿著婚紗

273
00:20:10,770 --> 00:20:12,470
You got a wedding dress?
你買到婚紗了？

274
00:20:12,670 --> 00:20:16,300
-Yeah, but I'm not keeping it. -Then why can't I see it?
-對，但我要把它退回去 -那麼我為什麼不能看到它？

275
00:20:16,580 --> 00:20:18,410
Oh. I guess you can.
我猜應該可以

276
00:20:18,650 --> 00:20:21,770
But I have to return it, so you can't like it.
但我得把它退回去 所以你絕不能喜歡它

277
00:20:21,980 --> 00:20:25,180
Okay, I promise. I'll hate it.
好吧，我發誓我會恨它

278
00:20:30,790 --> 00:20:35,090
Wow. You look hideous.
哇，你看起來好可怕

279
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:36,820
Really?
真的嗎？

280
00:20:37,030 --> 00:20:41,970
Yeah. That's like the most ugliest dress I've ever seen.
對，那是我看過最醜的婚紗

281
00:20:42,170 --> 00:20:44,190
Why do you have to return it?
你為什麼要把它退回去？

282
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:47,410
Because it doesn't really fit.
因為它真的不合適

283
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:49,670
Oh, I booked The Swing Kings.
還有，我訂了搖擺國王

284
00:20:49,910 --> 00:20:52,810
Oh, that's great. Thanks.
那真的是太棒了，謝謝

285
00:20:53,010 --> 00:20:55,710
But that dress is terrible.
但那件婚紗可怕極了

286
00:20:55,950 --> 00:20:59,480
-It makes me want to rip it off you. -Okay.
-它讓我想把它從你身上扯下來 -好吧

287
00:20:59,690 --> 00:21:01,420
But you can't rip it.
但你不可以把它弄破

288
00:21:01,660 --> 00:21:03,450
Well, maybe a little.
或許弄破一點也沒關係

289
00:21:12,870 --> 00:21:16,860
Guys, you want to look at the song list for the wedding?
你們想看看婚禮上 演唱歌曲的清單嗎？

290
00:21:17,340 --> 00:21:18,500
Guys?
怎麼了？

291
00:21:18,710 --> 00:21:20,870
I thought you'd be gone all day.
我還以為你會去一整天

292
00:21:21,070 --> 00:21:23,770
All right, what's going on?
好吧，發生了什麼事？

293
00:21:31,950 --> 00:21:36,080
I'm sorry. I should probably leave you girls alone.
對不起，或許我應該 讓你們這些小女生獨處一下

294
00:21:36,790 --> 00:21:41,920
Laugh all you want, but in 10 minutes we'll have younger-looking skin.
儘管笑吧，但十分鐘後 我們的皮夫會變得又白又嫩

295
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:47,560
You know, she could use a little...
她該敷一下臉的…

296
00:21:48,570 --> 00:21:50,930
Oh, nice shot! Yeah!
好球！太帥了！

297
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


298
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


